    <string name="shizuku_steps">How to connect Shizuku:
1. Open the Shizuku app (installed from GitHub).
2. Press Start — via ADB (wireless debugging) or via Root.
3. Allow NitroBoost when the Shizuku window appears.
The app keeps checking by itself until connected. On rooted devices, Root is used automatically when Shizuku is unavailable.</string>
